#: ../../source/production/dynamo_coordination.rst:102
msgid ""
"Install `Dynamo "
"<https://docs.nvidia.com/dynamo/dev/kubernetes/installation/install-"
"dynamo#install-the-dynamo-platform>`_. Its Kubernetes operator manages "
"the frontend and inference workers defined in a ``DynamoGraphDeployment``"
" resource."
