#: ../../source/production/dynamo_coordination.rst:133
msgid ""
"`agg_lmcache_mp.yaml "
"<https://github.com/LMCache/LMCache/blob/dev/examples/dynamo_integration/kubernetes/agg_lmcache_mp.yaml>`_"
" defines a ``DynamoGraphDeployment`` with a frontend and one vLLM worker."
" The worker serves ``Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B`` on one GPU and handles both "
"prefill and decode."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/production/dynamo_coordination.rst:139
msgid ""
"The worker mounts ``lmcache-mp-connection`` at ``/etc/lmcache``, making "
"the configuration available as ``/etc/lmcache/kv-transfer-config.json``. "
"At startup, it passes the file's JSON contents to ``--kv-transfer-"
"config`` to connect to the LMCache server on its node."
msgstr ""

